          ],
          "benefits_md": "\n- **Stipend:** ₹250/- per trainee.- **Other Facilities:** Dining facility, training literature kit, experiential education tour, trainee kit, etc.\n",
          "briefDescription": "The \"Training Scheme for Horticulture Skill Development to Landless Farm Labour at Centre of Excellence of Department\" aims to provide skill development training in horticulture to landless farm labourers through the Centres of Excellence.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The \"Training Scheme for Horticulture Skill Development to Landless Farm Labour at Centre of Excellence of Department\" introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, is designed to uplift landless agricultural workers by equipping them with essential horticulture skills through training. Conducted across Gujarat, the training spans a minimum of three days to a maximum of five days and includes modules like experiential learning tours, training kits, stipend, expert-led sessions, and more."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The &amp;quot;Training Scheme for Horticulture Skill Development to Landless Farm Labour at Centre of Excellence of Department&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, is designed to uplift landless agricultural workers by equipping them with essential horticulture skills through training. Conducted across Gujarat, the training spans a minimum of three days to a maximum of five days and includes modules like experiential learning tours, training kits, stipend, expert-led sessions, and more.\n",
